---LINES
var     = pvi   -       -       -       -         "3.141593"
vari    = pvix  -       -       -       -         "3.141593"
varc    = pvix  -       -       -       -         "        " 
alt1    = paix  -       -       -       -         "YES"
a2      = aix   -       -       -       -         "[x]"
mse     = ipmx  -       -       -       -         " Quit "
VAR     = gv  - - - - " VAR "
ALT     = ga  - - - - " ALT "
MSE     = gm  - - - - " MSE "
VARi    = gvx - - - - " VAR "
ALTi    = gax - - - - " ALT "
MSEi    = gmx - - - - " MSE "                       
                                                     
common  = h  " common: "                             
page_n  = h  " page navigation: "                                               
specia  = h  " special: "                                                      
                                                                               
---SCREEN                                                                                     
."actions on active lines"......................... .common....................                                                  
                                                                                *
+ start edit a line -              .VAR. .VARi        .:HE... help              *   
+              - untouched: .:SP...                   .:EX... exit/close page   *
+           - clear before: .:DE...                   .:NL... commit,complete   *
+ alter a line (toggle) -          .ALT. .ALTi        .:CA... cancel            *
+                - forward: .:SP...                   .:RE... refresh page      *
+               - backward: .:DE...                                             *
+ select menu item:                .MSE. .MSEi      .page_n.................... *
+                .:NL... or .:SP...                   .:TA... next line         *  
+                                                     .:KH... jump to 1st line  *
."in edit mode"................... ."with prefix".    .:KE... jump to last line *
+ .:DE... erase left from cursor                      .:PD... next page/part    *
+ .:KD... erase below cursor       .:PR .:DE...       .:PU... prev page/part    *
+                erase up to end   .:PR .:SP...                                 *
+ .:KH... jump to 1st symbol       .:PR .:AL...     .specia.................... *
+ .:KE... jump to end of text      .:PR .:AR...       .:KP... keypad on/off     *   
+ .:KI... toggle Ins/Ovr mode      .:PR .:PR...       .:PR... prefix            *
+                                                                               *
=VISI/LINLIB (c) 1986-1990, 2020-2024 vsv & team 


---END                          
